From 831677c11af382aaa051f1843ceccba471e4e3f8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kuzma30 <kuzemkoa@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 14:46:28 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 17/24] Modeling Algorithms - Roll the ball around a concave
 edge at a fillet corner

FreeCAD issue 20085: a cube with fillets of radius 6 on all edges and a
square hole of 8 x 8 through it. The walls of the hole go along the
tangent lines of the fillets of the cube, so the edges of the hole are
lines on the cylinders of those fillets. Filleting them froze FreeCAD
(OCCT 7.8) or gave a corner turned inside out at one corner of each end
of the hole.

At a corner of the hole two fillets of the same radius have no common
support face: they end on one point of the vertical edge of the hole,
while their other supports end on the sphere of the corner of the cube,
centered on that edge. The ball rolls around the edge there, so the
corner is a part of a torus whose axis is the edge and whose major and
minor radii are the radius of the fillet, tangent to the sphere.
ChFi3d_Builder::PerformTwoCornerOnRevolution builds it when the face of
revolution is a sphere centered on the edge or a plane normal to it.

Fixes found on the way:
- ChFi3d_StripeEdgeInter matched the side 0 of a corner piece (a side
  shrinking to a point, no face) as a common face and reported fillets
  with too big radii.
- ChFi3d_IsInFront asked the parameters of the vertex on a common face
  of surfdatas further from the corner, which does not contain it: it
  takes the projection of the vertex then.
- ChFi3d_FilBuilder::PerformTwoCorner dereferenced a null pivot when the
  two fillets end on different edges: it reports a failure now.
- ChFi3d_Builder::PerformCapOnEndFace counts only the crossings of the
  cap curve inside the parametric box of the fillet, not those with far
  parts of an analytic fillet surface.

All 8 edges of the hole filleted with r = 0.5 to 2.9 give valid shapes
with tolerance 1e-4 (r = 2: 129.34 mm3 removed). The r = 3 limit is
geometric: the fillet does not fit between the wall and the cylinder of
radius 6.

New DRAW test bugs/modalg_8/fillet_rounded_cube_square_hole (new data
file freecad20085_rounded_cube_pocket.brep) and GTest
BRepFilletAPI_MakeFilletTest.SquareHoleInRoundedCube_RollsBallAroundHoleEdges.

